            <ArticleTitle>What's causing the pain?: a re-examination of the Aikido Nikyo technique.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1585-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Recently there have been several investigations into the etiology of the pain produced on the application of Aikido's Nikyo (Second-teaching). This paper analyzes several conclusions as to the discrepancies found in the results of these studies.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
